lwuO-bDeJzt1xsI7AAAA: Sending packet MESSAGE data 2["chatwoot_event",{"event":"message_created","payload":{"account":{"id":1,"name":"CGVTelecom"},"additional_attributes":{},"content_attributes":{},"content_type":"text","content":"Hi b\u1ea1n,\n\nCGV Telecom cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u1ec1 Cloud Server v\u00e0 thu\u00ea m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7, nh\u01b0ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i m\u00ecnh ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 g\u00f3i RAM 1T v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.\n\nChi ph\u00ed s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n (s\u1ed1 nh\u00e2n CPU, dung l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u1ed5 c\u1ee9ng, b\u0103ng th\u00f4ng, h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c tri\u1ec3n khai cloud hay dedicated server...). B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho m\u00ecnh bi\u1ebft th\u00eam:\n\n- B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n cloud server hay m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 v\u1eadt l\u00fd?\n- D\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u00f9ng cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch g\u00ec (l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, x\u1eed l\u00fd d\u1eef li\u1ec7u l\u1edbn, ch\u1ea1y \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng...)?\n\nM\u00ecnh s\u1ebd ghi nh\u1eadn nhu c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb kinh doanh s\u1ebd g\u1eedi b\u00e1o gi\u00e1 chi ti\u1ebft t\u1edbi b\u1ea1n trong th\u1eddi gian s\u1edbm nh\u1ea5t nh\u00e9. Ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean h\u1ec7 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp hotline **1900 9191** ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i/email, m\u00ecnh s\u1ebd k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi chuy\u00ean vi\u00ean t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n ngay \u1ea1.","conversation":{"additional_attributes":{},"can_reply":true,"channel":"Channel::Api","contact_inbox":{"id":4,"contact_id":4,"inbox_id":1,"source_id":"dbe386c9-4abc-4ad6-8948-f95bdae18b6b","created_at":"2026-03-09T08:45:03.055Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T08:45:03.055Z","hmac_verified":false,"pubsub_token":"Uvmupr3Hc1NfWc2TddwvvJqW"},"id":59,"inbox_id":1,"messages":[{"id":957,"content":"Hi b\u1ea1n,\n\nCGV Telecom cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u1e